  "notes": "{守|まも}る has two main meanings: to protect and to follow/obey.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nType: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nMEANING 1 (PROTECT):\n- ⟦{家族|かぞく}→家族：00552_kazoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{守|まも}る: to protect one's family\n- ⟦{国|くに}→国：02204_kuni⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{守|まも}る: to defend the country\n- ⟦{身|み}→身：01764_mi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{守|まも}る: to protect oneself\n\nMEANING 2 (OBEY/FOLLOW):\n- ⟦ルール→ルール：00354_ruuru⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{守|まも}る: to follow rules\n- ⟦{約束|やくそく}→約束：01517_yakusoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{守|まも}る: to keep a promise\n- ⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{守|まも}る: to be punctual\n- ⟦マナー→マナー：11139_manaa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{守|まも}る: to observe manners\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{攻|せ}める→攻める：02123_semeru⟧: to attack (vs. protect)",
